  the sprite sheet file                             the canvas
  +------+------+------+
  |      |      |      |                      +----------------------+
  |      |      |      |                      |                      |
  +------+------+------+                      |     +--------+       |
  |      |      |      |       "copy"         |     |        |       |
  |      | cut  |      |  ------------------> |     | drawn  |       |
  +------+------+------+                      |     +--------+       |
  |      |      |      |                      |                      |
  |      |      |      |                      |                      |
  +------+------+------+                      +----------------------+

  "sx, sy"  where to cut                      "dx, dy"  where to draw
  "sw, sh"  how big to cut                    "dw, dh"  how big to draw
